  "method": "Scratch uvicorn server on a free port with a throwaway SQLite DB (PACT_DB_PATH), PayPal client id/secret and the LLM key popped from the server env so the app boots in demo mode (verified via /api/health mode=demo). 50 deals driven concurrently (semaphore 10) with asyncio + httpx through create, negotiate/run, pay, deliver, verify, repeating deliver/verify on revision rounds until a terminal state (released/refunded). Latency measured client-side with time.perf_counter around each HTTP op; percentiles are linear-interpolation over the measured values. Deal params from random.Random(seed): scenario cycles the 14 ids, buyer_max = default * U(0.7,1.3), seller_floor = default * U(0.7,1.1) (buyer_max floored at 1.2x floor so negotiation converges), bond_percent = U(5,40); the procurement scenario keeps its market-grounded defaults. The live dev server and data/pact.db were not touched."
}
